1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,260
Hey Josh. Here's how ISO Desk fits into

2
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:03,660
your day.

3
00:00:03,869 --> 00:00:05,469
The first time you sign in,

4
00:00:05,429 --> 00:00:07,749
click Import, and drop in your contacts,

5
00:00:07,549 --> 00:00:10,289
or your list from SmartMCA.

6
00:00:10,607 --> 00:00:12,467
Each company becomes a shop,

7
00:00:12,267 --> 00:00:14,487
with its people. Click Import.

8
00:00:14,786 --> 00:00:16,286
Then click Turn on,

9
00:00:16,346 --> 00:00:18,626
so follow-ups pop up on your screen.

10
00:00:18,884 --> 00:00:21,344
From then on, every morning starts on Today.

11
00:00:21,764 --> 00:00:23,324
Your follow-ups are at the top,

12
00:00:23,504 --> 00:00:24,504
late ones first.

13
00:00:24,742 --> 00:00:27,262
Below that: deals waiting on paperwork,

14
00:00:27,622 --> 00:00:28,902
and renewals that are ready.

15
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:30,460
When a follow-up is due,

16
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:33,140
it pops up, even with the desk closed.

17
00:00:33,336 --> 00:00:36,796
Click Call, and Connect UC dials the shop.

18
00:00:36,975 --> 00:00:38,195
When you hang up,

19
00:00:38,215 --> 00:00:40,195
click Hung up, and pick how it went.

20
00:00:40,350 --> 00:00:42,550
Jot a note, pick the next follow-up,

21
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:44,890
and save. The old one closes for you.

22
00:00:45,007 --> 00:00:46,347
To add a follow-up anytime,

23
00:00:46,627 --> 00:00:48,207
click Follow-up, type who,

24
00:00:48,427 --> 00:00:49,207
and pick when.

25
00:00:49,659 --> 00:00:50,759
To text a shop,

26
00:00:50,859 --> 00:00:52,859
click Text, and pick a template.

27
00:00:53,119 --> 00:00:54,419
It fills in what's missing.

28
00:00:54,715 --> 00:00:57,955
Click Copy text, then paste it into Connect

29
00:00:57,755 --> 00:00:59,055
UC and send.

30
00:00:59,292 --> 00:01:00,992
When a shop sends you a deal,

31
00:01:01,312 --> 00:01:03,612
go to Deals, and click Log a submission.

32
00:01:03,871 --> 00:01:05,071
Type the business name.

33
00:01:05,331 --> 00:01:06,851
If another shop sent it first,

34
00:01:07,171 --> 00:01:08,031
it tells you.

35
00:01:08,128 --> 00:01:09,528
Deals move left to right.

36
00:01:09,748 --> 00:01:11,468
Drag a card when it moves forward.

37
00:01:11,768 --> 00:01:13,708
If anything's missing, it tells you.

38
00:01:14,141 --> 00:01:16,201
Click any deal to tick off paperwork,

39
00:01:16,421 --> 00:01:18,161
record offers, and mark it funded.

40
00:01:19,420 --> 00:01:21,800
That's it. Start every day on Today,

41
00:01:21,940 --> 00:01:23,640
and the desk keeps track of the rest.
